abstract: >
  An open-source Wang-Landau/multicanonical (WL/MUCA) sampler for
  two-dimensional causal set quantum gravity, validated against the
  Glaser-O'Connor-Surya finite-size-scaling formula and against
  Cunningham & Surya's dimensionally-restricted lattice gas, plus a new
  random-background (quenched Poisson) variant of that lattice gas
  comparing it against the regular-lattice original at n=30 and n=50.
  See results/writeup/paper.md for the full write-up.
preferred-citation:
